Typed error tree — discriminate failure modes via `isinstance`. The transport layer maps HTTP status codes onto these classes.
```
from vxsdk import (
    VxError, VxAuthError, VxValidationError, VxNotFoundError,
    VxRateLimitError, VxServerError, VxNetworkError,
)

try:
    c.deploy.container(image="…", name="…", host="…", ssh_user="ubuntu",
                       key_pair_name="…")
except VxAuthError:
    print("re-run vxcli auth login")
except VxValidationError as e:
    print("bad input:", e)
except (VxRateLimitError, VxServerError, VxNetworkError):
    # these are isRetryable — back off + retry
    raise
```

