// GLOBAL and irreversible — removes the person for EVERY tenant, strips
// them from every org's saved leads, and blocks a re-crawl. The type
// itself demands the acknowledgement: confirmGlobalErasure is `true`,
// not `boolean`, so `false` will not compile.
// await c.leads.requestErasure({
//   email: 'person@example.com',
//   confirmGlobalErasure: true,
// });
```

