errors — Typed error tree — discriminate failure modes via `instanceof`.
discriminate errors:
```
import {
  VxAuthError, VxValidationError, VxRateLimitError,
  VxServerError, VxNetworkError, isRetryable,
} from '@vxcloud/sdk';

try {
  await c.deploy.container({ /* … */ });
} catch (err) {
  if (err instanceof VxAuthError)        { /* re-run vxcli auth login */ }
  else if (err instanceof VxValidationError) throw err;
  else if (isRetryable(err))             { /* back off + retry */ }
  else                                    throw err;
}
```

